      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būgomi bo ng'wa Koola",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu shikū jenījo Koola ng'witūnja o ng'wa Iziha, wa mu kaya ya ng'wa Kohati, lūganda lo Lawī, ūdimana na banhū balebe ba numba ya ng'wa Lubeni, ba Dasani na Abilamu bitūnja ba ng'wa Eliabu; na Oni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Peleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo bitūla shikuba kwilwisha nū Musa; baalī hamò na Baisiaeli bangī magana abīlī na makūmi atanò, abo baalī bakumūkile, nīyo nabo baalī bamò ba bataale ba ng'wibanza īlo lyalī lyasolwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo bakikuminga ibità būnsanga ū Musa nū Alooni kūbahoogagūja mihayo balīhaya, “Ng'wajile no ning'we; a banhū a bose aba balī beela, pye a bose ūmo bagelelile, nū SEEBA alī hamò nabo. Hama nibūla a bing'we mukwigūngūhyaga gīko, na kwitūūla kūbiza bataale baalyo pyī ī libità lya ng'wa SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa aho wīyigwa ī yenīyo ūgwa hasī achimīgije ū būshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla ū Koola na a biye, “Ī ntondo ī dilū ū SEEBA akoolecha hape nani ūyo alī wakwe, na nani ūyo alī ng'wela. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo h'ūyo akūng'weegeleja kūlī we; hū ng'wene ūyo akūnsola ang'wītane wegeele kūlī we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū bebe Koola na a banwani biyo ītagi gūūyū mhayo, solagi mazuukījo ga būbbani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ī ntondo mutūūle mo moto na būbbani, muzuukīje kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. Ū munhū ūyo SEEBA alansole hū ng'wene ūyo akūbiza ng'wela. A bing'we bitūnja ba ng'wa Lawī, ū widūndūgaja wing'we bookīlanījaga!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūng'wīla ū Koola na, “Alilūūlū bitūnja ba ng'wa Lawī, degelekagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we, mutaalī dūhū ū kūfula nūūlū mulībona gīkī ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli wamukomanya kwīnga ū ng'wibità lya Baisilaeli, ūng'wegeleja hihī nang'hwe, gīkī muyūbeeja nīmo mu numba ya ng'wa SEEBA,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Numba ya ng'wa SEEBA:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ipandī lya kwikala SEEBA.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na kwīmīīla kū būtongi wa banhū bose na kūtūmama milīmo ya kūbagunanha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we hamò na a Balawī biching'wi, ū Seba ang'wegelegije mung'wegeele; ī haha mulīhaya kūgūgwīlīīla nū nīmo gwa būgabīji! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe na a balondeeji bako pye a bose ng'walyaga gwīnda ya kwilwisha na SEEBA. Ū Alooni nani, nose mundugumīle?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Musa ūbitana a ba Dasani nū Abilamu, a bitūnja ba ng'wa Eliabu; alīyo būlema balīhaya, “Yaya a bise ū kwiza ū kwenūko! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūkatwīnja Misili ū kū sī ya būhondo, ūtwenha kwitogolo kūūnū kwiza kūtūmala; gashi ūtaalī dūhū ū kwigeja, nose ī haha ūtogilwe na kūtūsuga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya ya yose yenīyo, ū kū sī ya būhondo ūtaalī kūtūshisha, nū gwa kūtwinha malaale ga wingīji wise nago gwakūlemeelile, ndūhū dūhū nūūlū migūnda ya mizabibu. Ū bebe ūlītogwa kūgabbokuja a miso ga banhū benaba; yaya a bise ūkwiza ū kwenūko!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa kūbalombela banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Musa ūpelana no, ūng'wīla ū SEEBA, “Ūtizūshanukūla ī shakwinha shabo; ū nene nataalī kūdaatya nūūlū nzobe ya munhū ose ose, nūūlū kūnkenya munhū mubo nataalī gete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūng'wīla ū Koola, “Ī ntondo nzūgū na a balondeeji bako; ū bebe na a boi hamò nū Alooni mulize kwiyoolecha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī munhū wize n'izuukījo lya būbbani, mutūūle mo nū būbbani, ng'wize nago kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; a gose gabize mazuukījo magana abīlī na makūmi atanò.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana būsola, būlī ng'wene izuukījo lyakwe lya būbbani, būtūūla mo nū būbbani, hūna bīmīīla a ha nyango gwa kwingīla ng'wiheema, nū Musa ūbiza ho hamò nū Alooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Koola walī wabakuminga ha nyango gwiheema pye a balondeeji bakwe, kwiza kūbalemeja ī yabo a ba Musa nū Alooni. Alīyo kwimanīla ī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA lyiyoolecha ū kū banhū pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa nū Alooni gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ikomanyagi a bing'we ng'wīnge ū ng'wibità lyenīlī, nabamale pyī ī haha yenīyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a ba Musa nū Alooni būgwa bachimīgije hasī ū būshū wabo būlīla balīhaya, “Mulungu bebe ūyo ūlī Mulungu wa myoyo ya banhū bose, ūkūlīpelanīla pyī ī libità alīyo ū nkenaagūji alī ūmò dūhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bawīlage a banhū gīkī, ‘Gasegenelagi a maheema ga ba Koola nū Dasani nū Abilamu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango gwa bagome",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūbūūka, ūja aho walī Dasani na Abilamu, na a banamhala ba Baisilaeli būnondeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbahūgūla a banhū alīhaya, “Īngagi mugasegenele a maheema ga banhū benaba, nguno babūbi no; yaya nūūlū kūkuumya shikolo shabo shose shose, mutizūjaananījiwa mu būkenaagūji wabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana būgasegenela a maheema ga ba Koola, Dasani, nū Abilamu; ū Dasani nu Abilamu baalī baafuma ū mu maheema gabo, bīīmīīla ha milyango hamò na a bake babo na a bitūnja babo, pye na a banīgīnī a bado bado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūhaya, “Ū mhayo ūyū hū gūkūng'olekeja gīkī ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ūyo anitūmile ū kwīta pyī ī yenīyī, mukūdeeba gīkī ī lyenīlī lītī iganiko lyane lya ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benaba ūlū balache lūfu ūlo banhū bose bakachaaga, bagwīlwe mhayo gītī īyo īkabagwīlaga banhū bose dūhū, numho ū SEEBA atanitūmile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA ūlū alenhe shikolo shingī nasho gete, īsho shitaalī kwilonga na ikanza līngī hangī, ī sī yūkundūka na kūbamila, nī shose īsho balī nasho, būbiza baajīīkwa mu shigila balī bapanga gīko, a henaho hū mukūdeeba gīkī a banhū benaba bandalahaga ū SEEBA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wakalīcha dūhū ū kūhaya ī yenīyo, haho na haho ī sī yūlekaana aho baalī bīmīīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yūkundūka yūbamila nī kaya jabo, pye nū Koola na a banhū bakwe, nī sabo jabo jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bika mu shigila bataalī bapanga gīko, pye nī shikolo shabo ī shose; ī sī yilugala na kwilugala; būbiza bayagaala, bīnga ū ng'wibità lya banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balīīlīla, pye a Baisilaeli abo baalī bbihī nabo būpeela balīīlīla bakūhayaga, “Na a bise īkūtūmila ī sī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na moto gwika kūfuma kūlī SEEBA gūūbayagaja abo magana abīlī na makūmi atanò abo baazuukījaga būbbani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wīlage ū Elieza ū ng'witūnja wa ngabīji Alooni agīnje a mazuukījo ga būbbani ū mu moto ūyo gūlīzuukīīla, na a makala agasalang'hanye gasambaale. Nguno a mazuukījo ga būbbani genayo gabizaga meela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayo baalī nago a banhū abo bīītaga mihayo ya kūbakenaagūja būpanga wabo boi benekīlī. A mazuukījo ga būbbani genayo gapondagūlage ūgasule ūbeeje ibbaadi lya kūkundīkīja ha ng'walīlo. A genayo galī meela nguno gaalī gafunyiagwa kūlī SEEBA; na lūūlū gakūbiza lūmeeng'ho ū kū Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Elieza ūgakuminga a mazuukījo ga būbbani ga shaba ayo baalī baagenha abo bakapya moto būcha; gūpondagūlwa, lyūbeejiwa ikundīkījo lya ha ng'walīlo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīīla ū Elieza mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa. Ū mhayo gwenūyū gwalī gwa kūbizūkīja gīkī atīho ūngī ū wa kwegeela kūzuukīja būbbani kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ūlū atī wa shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Alooni; ūlū wīta gīko akūng'wikola Koola na balondeeji bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banhū kūgwīlwa ikūla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ntodo yaho ī libità lya Baisilaeli lyūbadugumīla a ba Musa nū Alooni līlīhaya, “A bing'we ng'wababūlagile a banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū abo baalī ng'wibità īlo lyalī libilinga kwiza kūbalemeja ī yabo a ba Musa nū Alooni, aho balola ū kwiheema lya kwibilingīla, būlībona ī lilunde lyalīkundīkīja ī liheema, nī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA lilonga ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a ba Musa nū Alooni beegeela a ha būtongi wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Īngagi a bing'we ū ng'wibità lyenīlī nalīyagaje ī haha īyī.” Būūgwa hangī bachimīgije hasī ū būshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Musa ūng'wīla ū Alooni, “Solaga wangū ī lizuukījo lyako lya būbbani, ūtūūle mo būbbani na moto gwa kūfuma ha ng'walīlo, ūpeele ū kū banhū ūkababeegeje isangī; lyandyaga ikūla nguno wikaga būpelanu kūfuma kūlī SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Alooni wīta ūmo akawīlīlwa na Musa, ūspeela ajile ū kū banhū ūkiguulanya mu gatī gatī yabo. Ī likūla lyalī lyamala kwandya, alīyo ū Alooni ūpemba ū būbbani ūbīītīla isangī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wīmīīla a ha gatī ya babo baalī baamala kūcha na a bapanga, ī likūla lyooya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū abo bakacha kūlwa nguno y'ikūla bakashika shihūmbī ikūmi na shinè na magana mpungatī, kūleka abo baalī baacha kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Koola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyooya ī likūla, ū Alooni ūshoka ū kūlī Musa, ū kū nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
